 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Divine Artifact Master: My Infinite Goddess Contracts"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "神级御物：我无限契约女神"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lin Fang awakens an SSS-level artifact mastery talent, granting him the power to turn anything into a divine weapon. Armed with an invincible holy sword, clad in god-tier armor, and riding a flashy motorcycle, he reveals a shocking truth: all his equipment is formed from his contracted goddesses!\n\nAs terrifying beasts invade and the apocalypse descends, Lin Fang fights alongside his goddess companions. With love and power intertwined, he vows: “Wife, let’s ascend to the throne of the strongest—together!”",
   "zh": "觉醒SSS级御物天赋，手持无敌圣剑，身穿神级铠甲，骑着拉风的摩托车，林放：我这身装备都是女神变的！异兽入侵，末世降临？老婆，随我一起杀上巅峰王座！"
  },
